    "notes": "APG defines no arrow keys for accordion; Radix and Base UI add ArrowDown/ArrowUp/Home/End between headers as an extra. None of the keys is direction-sensitive. The expand chevron is an icon concern (it points to inline-end when collapsed in some designs and must mirror)."
